# New custom drama up to its story outline.
# Starts: the Launcher (any scroll position). Ends: the chat with 「Possible Characters:」 (or a failure text, which
# stops the recipe). Charges nothing.
# Args: $1 idea text · $2 language button index (0 = English) · $3 captions button index (0 = Yes)
# Written 2026-10-20 from the P1 command history (TC-030/TC-032 setup). First run 10/20 19:21 (P23-b): `type` took 65 s
# and the last waitfor timed out with the outline done because 「Possible Characters」 sat below the fold → setval, and
# wait for the result header first, then scroll to the bottom and wait for the character card.
# Usage: node scripts/device.ts <run dir> do library/pdr/ai-mini-drama/ios/recipes/new-drama.steps "A lighthouse keeper …" 0 0
?tapif launcher.UIButton.homeButton
drag 210 300 210 800 300
drag 210 300 210 800 300
lbl AI Mini Drama
waitfor aiMiniDramaEntry.UIButton.createDrama --timeout 20
id aiMiniDramaEntry.UIButton.createDrama
waitfor aiMiniDramaComposer --timeout 15
setval aiMiniDramaComposer.UITextView.text "$1"
id aiMiniDramaComposer.UIButton.send
?hidekb
waitfor aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.continue --timeout 60
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.language.$2
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.captions.$3
id aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.continue
waitfor "Story Outline & Characters Result|Something went wrong|Server is busy|Try again" --timeout 240
expect-not "Something went wrong|Server is busy"
?id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.scrollToBottom
waitfor "Ready to create your characters?|Something went wrong|Server is busy|Try again" --timeout 120
?id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.scrollToBottom
expect-not "Something went wrong|Server is busy"
